---
// Buttondown "After subscribing" redirect. noindex + out of the sitemap.
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Check your inbox to confirm" description="Confirm your Kitchen Watcher newsletter subscription from the email we just sent." noindex>
  <article>
    <h1>Almost done: check your inbox</h1>
    <p class="dek">We just sent you an email from Buttondown. Click the confirmation link in it to start getting new guides and recall alerts, about once a month.</p>
    <h2>Don't see it?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Give it a few minutes, then check your spam or promotions folder.</li>
      <li>Make sure you typed your address correctly. If not, sign up again from the form at the bottom of any page.</li>
      <li>Still nothing? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> and we'll sort it out.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Until you confirm, we won't send you anything. How we handle your address is on our <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
